      #|  !(f:A->B) s t.\n     (!x y. x IN s /\\ y IN s /\\ f x IN t /\\ f y IN t /\\ f x = f y ==> x = y) /\\\n     t SUBSET IMAGE f s\n     ==> {x | x IN s /\\ f x IN t} =_c t
